1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,410
Why does a man pull away

2
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:03,150
from the woman he loves,

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,995
right when life gets hardest?

4
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:06,420
From the outside,

5
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:07,960
it makes no sense.

6
00:00:08,010 --> 00:00:09,180
If he loves her,

7
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:10,685
why would he push her away?

8
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,800
But here's something

9
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:14,480
most people don't understand.

10
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,150
What a man feels

11
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,130
and how he deals with those feelings

12
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:20,135
are two very different things.

13
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,510
When everything in his life

14
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:23,090
starts falling apart,

15
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,270
when he feels lost, exhausted,

16
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,000
and completely out of control,

17
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,250
he isn't thinking about

18
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,870
how to keep her close.

19
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:30,950
He's thinking about how to keep

20
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,825
his problems from reaching her.

21
00:00:33,190 --> 00:00:35,290
In his mind, it's simple:

22
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,780
If I'm on fire,

23
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,350
I need to protect the people I love

24
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,635
from getting burned.

25
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:40,850
Imagine his life

26
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,420
as a sinking ship.

27
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:44,260
Instead of asking her for help,

28
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:45,595
he pushes her away.

29
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,410
And he stays on board,

30
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:48,830
because it's his ship,

31
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:50,460
his responsibility.

32
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:52,340
He believes he has to save it…

33
00:00:52,390 --> 00:00:53,575
or sink with it.

34
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:55,860
Here's where things go wrong.

35
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,430
In trying to protect her,

36
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,530
he forgets how to let her love him.

37
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:00,740
He becomes distant.

38
00:01:00,790 --> 00:01:02,020
He stops talking.

39
00:01:02,070 --> 00:01:03,655
He shuts down emotionally.

40
00:01:03,910 --> 00:01:04,980
Not necessarily because

41
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:06,540
his feelings are gone,

42
00:01:06,590 --> 00:01:08,720
because somewhere deep inside,

43
00:01:08,770 --> 00:01:10,590
he believes he has to face everything

44
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:11,495
alone.

45
00:01:11,860 --> 00:01:13,160
And that's where so many men

46
00:01:13,210 --> 00:01:14,280
lose the very thing

47
00:01:14,330 --> 00:01:15,595
they're trying to protect.

48
00:01:15,890 --> 00:01:17,160
So many relationships

49
00:01:17,210 --> 00:01:18,190
end like this.

50
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,750
Not because the love disappeared,

51
00:01:19,890 --> 00:01:21,630
because she sees his silence

52
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,330
as rejection,

53
00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:24,760
and he sees her attempts to get closer

54
00:01:24,810 --> 00:01:26,240
as more pressure,

55
00:01:26,290 --> 00:01:27,240
instead of support.

56
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:28,830
If they could only understand

57
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:30,820
what the other person was going through,

58
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:31,530
they might've made it

59
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:32,915
through the storm together.

60
00:01:33,270 --> 00:01:35,310
So if he starts pulling away,

61
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,530
don't chase him.

62
00:01:36,580 --> 00:01:37,915
Don't disappear either.

63
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:39,350
Just let him know:

64
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,460
I'm not here to add to your problems.

65
00:01:41,510 --> 00:01:43,280
I'm here because I love you.

66
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:45,495
You don't have to go through everything alone.

67
00:01:45,770 --> 00:01:47,380
Because the right kind of closeness

68
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:49,270
doesn't make the storm heavier…

69
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:51,310
it makes it easier to survive.

70
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,500
Send this to someone

71
00:01:52,550 --> 00:01:53,770
who needs to hear it.

72
00:01:53,820 --> 00:01:56,380
And follow for more.
